Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 17:15:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] soc: samsung: b0s kexec boot: PMIC rail restore via ACPM,
 DPU takeover

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015Zi6dy8kB9rd8PzqHkWkui
---
 drivers/soc/samsung/Makefile      |   1 +
 drivers/soc/samsung/kx-b0s-boot.c | 278 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
